 M('Listening for meaning','Apply',5,['Play short clips at natural speed after first at slow speed.','Listen for gist first, then for details such as numbers and names.','Use songs, short stories and real announcements.','Give a task before playing so listening has a purpose.'],'Clip of a train announcement: first listen for the platform number, then for the time.','Design a listening task with a before, during and after step.','Task has a purpose, two listenings and a check.','What is listening for gist?','Listening for the main idea first.'),
 M('Reading and vocabulary','Apply',5,['Choose short texts at the learners level with 95 of 100 words known.','Teach word families and common word pairs.','Review new words after one day, three days and seven days.','Keep a personal word bank with a sentence from the learners own life.'],'The word book appears with read, write, open; the sentence: I read my book at night.','Prepare a text, ten target words and a review schedule.','Words are tied to learner-made sentences and a dated review plan.','What is spaced review?','Reviewing items at growing gaps to fix them in memory.'),
